# Line endings are normalised in the repository and checked out as LF everywhere.
# Without this, a commit from an editor defaulting to CRLF stores CRLF, and both
# formatters the quality gate runs — prettier and ruff format — reject it. The gate
# then fails on files nobody touched, on every branch cut from that point.
* text=auto eol=lf

frontend/prebuilt/** -diff
